:: Michael Hang Out First Time [nobr]

As you stand by the buses waiting for them to arrive to take you and the rest of the class home for the day, you suddenly find yourself surrounded on all sides by <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> and his goons. While this would normally be a death sentence, or at least a demeaning one, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> has taken a liking to you and does little more than playfully try to jump on your back and teasingly prod you until a teacher warns him to cut it out. The group of you then moves by one of the trees for shade while you continue waiting. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“-it’s like they think I was going to kill him or something. They need to chill the fuck out.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> is in the middle of a rant about the teacher who scolded him, acting tough but saying the curse words a bit quieter. This is one of the few days <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> has not gotten a detention, meaning he isn’t keen to get one this late in the game. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“It’s like they’ve never had fun in their lives! I wasn’t hurting <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$MichaelNickname</span>… well, not much anyway.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> smirks, punching you in the shoulder. You punch him back, leading to a little back and forth until the glare of the teacher stops you both. <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Michael",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Uniform",
                Mouth: "Smirk",
                Eyes: "Tired",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Smirk",
                Eyes: "Mad",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

Figuring there could be better places to have fun, away from the eyes of the school always watching for <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> and his friends to step out of line, you ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> if he wants to go somewhere with you. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oooo, like on a date?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> says teasingly as his goons chuckle and coo. You give some witty comeback or remark that would earn anyone else a smack, but you just get an amused smirk from <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span>. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sure thing, I’m down to hit up the arcade or grab a bite or something, but you’re paying if we do that.”</span> <span style="Color: LightGreen">He puts his arm around you as you say goodbye to his goons and begin to walk off.</span> The teacher continues to eye <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> until he is off school property. <br>
<<set $InActiveQuests.delete("Michael: Hang Out Intro")>>
<<set $CompletedQuests.push("Michael: Hang Out Intro")>>
<br>
<span style="color:Yellow">Where to Hang Out?</span><br>
<<link"The Park (0:10)<br>">>
    <<set $HangOutClothes to "Uniform">>
    <<set $Minutes += 10>>
    <<goto "Michael Hang Out Go To Park">>
<</link>>
